        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>英语语法笔记 - be going to / 疑问句 / 过去式</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #e8e8e8;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    background: #fff;\n    width: 540px;\n    padding: 25px 20px 40px 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .top-line {\n    background-color: #bfbfbf;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    display: inline;\n  }\n  .top-para {\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .heading {\n    color: #7a1f7a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px -18px;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .check {\n    color: #e05a8a;\n    font-style: italic;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -18px;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-family: cursive;\n    transform: rotate(-10deg);\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    background-color: #bfbfbf;\n    display: inline;\n    padding: 1px 3px;\n    box-decoration-break: clone;\n    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;\n  }\n  .body-wrap {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .note {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 10px;\n    top: -4px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: cursive, \"Comic Sans MS\";\n    font-size: 18px;\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n  }\n  .section13 {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-para\">\n    <span class=\"body-text\">字母 o, 加上 es 不用怒。\"辅音字母+y\"来结尾，变 y 为 i 是正规；es 后边</span><br>\n    <span class=\"body-text\">紧跟随， study&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;studies 看明白。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>8、\" be going to \"</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">be going to 表打算/准备/计划将要做。表可能/有必然，通过现象推；使</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">用它，要注意，疑问形式 be 提前。否定句更简单，not 放在 be 后边；to</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">之后，动原形，be 的形式看人称。</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>9、一般疑问句</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">一般疑问句,变起来很容易，be 动词往前提，变否定也容易，be 后 not 加</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">上去，针对 I 来提问，I 变 you 是常理。</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>10、特殊疑问句</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">特殊疑问句变起来有程序：第一，确定疑问词，第二，代替划线语，第三，</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">将疑问词放句首，疑问词后加一般疑问句，语序倒置要牢记。</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>11、祈使句</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">表命令和禁止 通常主语被省 原形动词放句首,否定 don't 就可以 Let's 也</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">是一句型，生活中常常用，祈使句不礼貌，使用分寸要把好</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">12、过去式</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">标准过去加 ed，少量不规则分别记，am,is 对 was，第二人称复数 are 变</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">were,have,has 用 had. do 和 does 变 did.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section section13\">\n    <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>13、规则动词过去式构成</div>\n    <div class=\"note\">加油!!</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">过去式构成，一般词尾把 ed 加。如果词尾有 e，直接加 d 就可以。\"辅音</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">字母+y\"在词尾，变 y 为 ed 加。\"一辅重闭\"作尾巴，双写之后 ed 加。</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span>14、There be 句型</div>\n    <div class=\"body-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"body-text\">There be 句型有规律，疑问否定都用 be，be 词可有不同形式，变疑问</span><br>\n      <span class=\"body-text\">提前，变否定也容易，be 后 not 填上去，some 用于肯定句，否定疑问用</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
